// A known spell, attached to its caster rather than carried (ADR 0014). It
// is a bolt along a line: `Spell` says how it is aimed and how much
// `power` it asks of a discipline, `SpellDamage` what it does on arrival.
// It scales with the stat of the discipline that casts it, not its own.
(
    components: [
        Name("firebolt"),
        Appearance(glyph: '*', fg: (255, 140, 40), bg: (0, 0, 0)),
        Spell(school: Pyromancy, range: 7, power: 2),
        SpellDamage(min: 3, max: 6),
    ],
)
